#' @param d_core `ParameterStore`. Distinct group4 D shared conv/score owner.
#' @param d_old_rgb `ParameterStore`. Distinct group5 D old RGB owner.
#' @param d_new_block `ParameterStore`. Distinct group6 D new block owner.
#' @param d_new_rgb `ParameterStore`. Distinct group7 D new RGB owner.
#' @param image `Tensor`. Finite signed matching real CPU\[N,8,8,1\], N>0.
#' @param noise `Tensor`. Finite signed matching CPU\[N,16\], same positive N.
#' @param alpha `Tensor`. Finite matching CPU scalar or\[1\] coefficient in\[0,1\], optionally live.
#' @return `ProgressiveGanOutput`: Owning seven-field ProgressiveGanOutput with both endpoint images and raw least-squares
#' objectives.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' #include <dm/dm.hpp>
#' namespace n=dm::nn;
#' n::ParameterStore a(6401),b(6407),c(6413),d(6421),e(6427),f(6449),g(6451),h(6469);
#' auto z=n::ones({2,16}),x=n::ones({2,8,8,1});
#' auto out=n::models::ProgressiveGan(a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,x,z,n::scalar_like(.5,z));
#' n::GradOptions options;options.retain_graph=true;options.allow_unused=true;
#' auto first_D=n::grad(out.d_loss,e.parameters(),options);
#' // Capture other active D groups BEFORE any optimizer writes, then a fresh G forward.
#' ```
#' @section Errors:
#' Signals an R error (from the C++ exception):
