#' @references - Karras et al. (2017/2018), https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.10196 .
#' - Mao et al. (2016/2017), Least Squares Generative Adversarial Networks,
#'   https://arxiv.org/abs/1611.04076 . This source's G scale is1, not.5.
#' @seealso ProgressiveGanOutput, ProgressiveActiveGroups(), ProgressiveGanGenerate(), ProgressiveGanDiscriminate()
#' @md
