#' @usage
#' NormalizedConv(p, state, name, input, out, height, width, cfg = ConvNormConfig$new(), stride = 1, padding = "SAME", relu = TRUE)
#' @param p `ParameterStore`. Learnable store; creates /W and /bn/beta plus /bn/gamma when scale=true.
#' @param state `ParameterStore`. Separate moving-mean/variance store, updated eagerly only in training with update_stats.
#' @param name `character`. Prefix for convolution and BN names.
