#' @param signal `Tensor`. Floating NHWC tensor matching the pooled shape.
#' @param window `integer`. Positive pooling width and height.
#' @param stride `integer`. Positive pooling stride.
#' @param padding `character`. SAME or VALID, case-sensitive.
