#' * `std::invalid_argument`: For invalid geometry, padding or incompatible signal shape/dtype.
#' @references - Zeiler and Fergus (2014), https://cs.nyu.edu/~fergus/papers/zeilerECCV2014.pdf
#' @seealso DeconvLayer(), ZFNetDeconvolution()
#' @md
