#' @param gate_bias `numeric`. Finite gate-bias initializer, default -2; used only on first creation.
#' @param activation `character (Activation)`. Transform activation, default ReLU; gate remains sigmoid.
#' @return `HighwayOutputs`: H, T and the coupled-carry mixture, all with input.shape() and their gradients.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' namespace n = dm::nn;
