#' @param gate_bias `numeric`. Finite gate-bias initializer, default -2; existing learned bias is reused.
#' @return `HighwayOutputs`: H, sigmoid T and coupled mixture, all with input.shape() and gradient graphs.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
