#' @param state `ParameterStore`. Mutable BN moving moments, with dtype matching p.
#' @param image `Tensor`. Nonempty floating NHWC tensor; stage-downsampled sides must be even.
#' @param cfg `PyramidNetConfig`. Validated layout and width settings; defaults CIFAR-110 alpha 48 basic.
#' @param training `logical`. True uses batch moments; updates state only if cfg.update_stats.
#' @return `PyramidNetOutputs`: Stem, every unit/width, stages, final features and logits with gradients.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' namespace n = dm::nn;
#' n::ParameterStore p(17), state(17);
#' n::models::PyramidNetConfig cfg;
#' cfg.depth = 8;
