#' @param kernel `integer`. Positive odd stride/shortcut depthwise side.
#' @param stride `integer`. One or two.
#' @param se_ratio `numeric`. Finite channel-reduction fraction in \[0,1\]; zero disables SE.
#' @return `Tensor`: Signed residual-plus-shortcut NHWC tensor with gradients.
