#' @usage
#' EfficientNetCoefficients(variant)
#' @param variant `integer`. Integer B index in \[0,7\].
#' @return `EfficientNetScaling`: Independent width/depth/reference-resolution/dropout metadata.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
