#' @section Errors:
#' Signals an R error (from the C++ exception):
#'
#' * `std::invalid_argument`: For invalid domain, unknown preset, unsupported dtype/shape,
#'   overflowing dimensions or incompatible stored entries.
#' @references - Tan et al. (2019), https://arxiv.org/abs/1807.11626; Tan and Le (2019),
