#' @param rows `Tensor`. Int64 \[B\] valid source-image indices; repeats are allowed.
#' @param boxes `Tensor`. Floating \[B,4\] finite ordered pixel-edge coordinates; input dtype is converted to images dtype.
#' @param side `integer`. Positive square output side, default28.
