#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' const auto padded =
#'     dm::nn::models::PadDetectionBoxes(dm::nn::tensor({0., 0., 10., 20.}, {1, 4}), .07);
#' ```
#' @section Errors:
#' Signals an R error (from the C++ exception):
#'
#' * `std::invalid_argument`: For malformed/nonfinite/reversed boxes or invalid fraction.
#' @references - Girshick et al. (2014), Rich feature hierarchies for accurate object detection and semantic segmentation, https://arxiv.org/abs/1311.2524
#' @seealso CropDetectionPatches()
#' @md
