#' @param labels `Tensor`. Int64 \[K\] class labels in\[0,C-1\]; final class is background.
#' @param targets `Tensor`. Floating \[K,4\] normalized regression targets in logits dtype; finite values are caller requirement.
#' @param mask `Tensor`. Floating \[K\] finite nonnegative regression weights in logits dtype; must be zero for background.
