#' @param state `ParameterStore`. Mutable same-dtype backbone BN moving state, checkpoint with p.
#' @param images `Tensor`. Positive floating NHWC with resolved square side and1/3 channels per cfg.
#' @param cfg `DetrConfig`. Valid class/backbone/transformer/query/dropout metadata.
#' @param training `logical`. False(default) uses moving BN and no dropout; true uses batch stats/optional updates and dropout.
#' @return `DetrOutputs`: Per-decoder-layer logits/normalized boxes plus encoder memory.
