#' * `std::invalid_argument`: For invalid geometry,dtypes,indices or configuration.
#' @references - Badrinarayanan,Kendall and Cipolla(2015), SegNet: A Deep Convolutional Encoder-Decoder Architecture for Image Segmentation, https://arxiv.org/abs/1511.00561; original implementation https://github.com/alexgkendall/SegNet-Tutorial.
#' @seealso SegNetIndexUnpool()
#' @md
