#' @param state `ParameterStore`. Same-dtype BN moving moments,updated during training.
#' @param images `Tensor`. Positive floating RGB NHWC matching both stores.
#' @param cfg `HRNetConfig`. Valid class,width,depth and positive module settings.
#' @param training `logical`. False(default) moving moments;true batch moments and moving updates.
#' @return `HRNetOutputs`: Input-aligned logits,coarse scores,four final branches and exchange count.
