#' MakeTensorInstanceScenes(digits, labels, cfg = DetectionSceneConfig$new())
#' @param digits `Tensor`. Float32/64\[N,28,28,1\] in\[0,1\],N positive.
#' @param labels `Tensor`. Aligned Int64\[N\] digit classes in\[0,10).
