#' * `std::invalid_argument`: For invalid settings,geometry,dtypes,indices,target values or incompatible model outputs.
#' @references - Bolya et al.(2019), YOLACT: Real-time Instance Segmentation, https://arxiv.org/abs/1904.02689. Background-last,32 sampled positive masks,pixel-centre targets and discrete crop-area normalization follow the source teaching adaptation.
