#' @param height `integer`. Positive source scene height.
#' @param width `integer`. Positive source scene width.
#' @return `TensorMaskDetections`: Detached box detections and Bool\[D,height,width\] pasted selected masks.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' namespace n = dm::nn;
