#' ```
#' @section Errors:
#' Signals an R error (from the C++ exception):
#'
#' * `std::invalid_argument`: For invalid settings,shapes,dtypes,nonfinite predictions or out-of-range IDs.
#' @references - Bolya et al.(2019), YOLACT: Real-time Instance Segmentation, https://arxiv.org/abs/1904.02689; teaching pixel-centre crops and mask pasting follow examples/nn/common/yolact.hpp.
#' @seealso TensorFastNms(), LinearInstanceMasks(), PasteInstanceMask()
