#' @references - Kirillov,Girshick,He and Dollár(2019),Panoptic Feature Pyramid Networks, https://arxiv.org/abs/1901.02446; aligned2x2 region sampling follows the source Mask R-CNN teaching convention.
#' @seealso PanopticRoiAlign(), MaskRcnnHead()
