#' // feature is[1,14,14,4]; only two top_decoder leaves are created.
#' ```
#' @section Errors:
#' Signals an R error (from the C++ exception):
#'
#' * `std::invalid_argument`: For invalid shapes/dtypes/values/products or incompatible leaves.
#' @references - Razavi, van den Oord and Vinyals (2019), Generating Diverse High-Fidelity
#'   Images with VQ-VAE-2, https://arxiv.org/abs/1906.00446 . Compact repeat/Conv
#'   teaching variant; the coarse feature conditions both fine encoding and decoding.
#' @seealso Vq2Decoder(), VectorQuantizedAutoencoder2()
#' @md
