#' image/noise/parameter paths stay live, including conditional-prior gradients.
#' Validates inputs and representable products before creating leaves. Existing
#' incompatible leaves or nonfinite computed endpoints may fail later. Inputs
#' unchanged; all outputs own lifetime. Synchronize shared stores. Work includes
#' O(B*(F*H+H*U+H*L+U*T+T*U+U*L+L*H)); activation storage is linear in B.
#' @usage
#' LadderVariationalAutoencoder(parameters, image, epsilon, features = 784, lower_latent = 4, top_latent = 2, hidden = 32, top_hidden = 16)
#' @param parameters `ParameterStore`. Mutable floating store; original seed2503.
#' @param image `Tensor`. Finite unit-range pixel matrix\[B,features\], B>0.
#' @param epsilon `Tensor`. Finite matching explicit Gaussian draws\[B,lower_latent+top_latent\].
#' @param features `integer`. Positive pixel width, default784.
#' @param lower_latent `integer`. Positive lower Gaussian width, default4.
#' @param top_latent `integer`. Positive top Gaussian width, default2.
#' @param hidden `integer`. Positive first-encoder/decoder ReLU width, default32.
#' @param top_hidden `integer`. Positive second-encoder/prior ReLU width, default16.
#' @return `LadderVaeOutput`: Owning sixteen-field output with differentiable scalar negative ELBO.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' #include <dm/dm.hpp>
