#' const auto gradients=n::grad(out.loss,p.parameters());
#' // Caller owns Adam and validation selection; all22 leaves retain their paths.
#' ```
#' @section Errors:
#' Signals an R error (from the C++ exception):
#'
#' * `std::invalid_argument`: For invalid input/dimensions or incompatible leaves.
#' @references - Sonderby, Raiko, Maaloe, Sonderby and Winther (2016), Ladder Variational
#'   Autoencoders, https://arxiv.org/abs/1602.02282 . Educational precision-fusion mechanism.
#' @seealso LadderVaeOutput, LadderPrecisionFusion(), ConditionalGaussianKl(), LadderPrior(), GaussianVaeDecode()
