#' @param weight `Tensor`. Finite matching frozen CPU\[3,3,3,64\] convolution values, detached on use.
#' @param bias `Tensor`. Finite matching frozen CPU\[64\] bias values, detached on use.
#' @return `Tensor`: Owning live unactivated feature tensor\[N,H,W,64\], frozen-weight paths stopped.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' #include <dm/dm.hpp>
#' namespace n=dm::nn;
#' auto x=n::ones({1,2,2,3}).requires_grad_();
