#'
#' * `std::invalid_argument`: For nonfloating mask dtype.
#' * `std::logic_error`: For unsupported primitive execution.
#' @references - Germain et al.(2015), MADE: Masked Autoencoder for Distribution Estimation,
#'   https://arxiv.org/abs/1502.03509 . Compact source uses deterministic degrees,
#'   two16-unit sigmoid layers and separately fitted raster/reverse models.
#' @seealso MadeMaskInventory, AutoregressiveDegreeMask(), MadeDensity()
#' @md
