#' // loss=log(2*pi)-.2, approximately 1.6378770664 nats/row.
#' ```
#' @section Errors:
#' Signals an R error (from the C++ exception):
#'
#' * `std::invalid_argument`: For invalid inputs/determinant geometry or nonfinite results.
#' * `std::logic_error`: For unsupported primitive execution.
