#' @section Errors:
#' Signals an R error (from the C++ exception):
#'
#' * `std::invalid_argument`: For invalid inputs/leaves or unrepresentable/nonfinite math.
#' * `std::logic_error`: For unsupported primitive execution.
#' @references - Rezende and Mohamed(2015), Variational Inference with Normalizing Flows,
#'   https://arxiv.org/abs/1505.05770 . This compact standalone density adaptation
#'   uses four2-D maps and explicit inverses; it is not a VAE/ELBO implementation.
#' @seealso PlanarRadialDensityOutput, PlanarRadialInverse(), ElementaryFlow(), NormalFlowDensity()
#' @md
