#' refit. O(steps*8N) work/retained graph storage; synchronize stores. Input/options
#' validate before leaves; stored-leaf/math failures may follow partial creation.
#' Reject nonfinite fields/results or unsafe global scale without clipping.
#' @usage
#' CnfInverse(parameters, latent, steps = 8, trace_mode = 3)
#' @param parameters `ParameterStore`. Caller-owned matching floating store, preferably forward-warmed with source seed10003.
#' @param latent `Tensor`. Finite matching floating CPU\[N,2\] explicit Gaussian coordinates, positive rows.
#' @param steps `integer`. Fixed RK4 count, default8, at least4 and divisible by4.
#' @param trace_mode `integer`. 0 exact,1 plus,2 minus,3(default) deterministic paired field trace.
#' @return `FlowScaleOutput`: Owning live FlowScaleOutput with observation value\[N,2\] and reverse-path integrated logdet\[N\].
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' #include <dm/dm.hpp>
#' namespace n=dm::nn;n::ParameterStore p(10003);
#' auto x=n::ones({2,2});auto path=n::models::CnfDensity(p,x);
#' auto rec=n::models::CnfInverse(p,path.latent);
#' // rec.value approximately recovers x; signed integrated traces approximately cancel.
#' ```
#' @section Errors:
#' Signals an R error (from the C++ exception):
#'
#' * `std::invalid_argument`: For invalid inputs/options/leaves or unrepresentable/nonfinite math.
#' * `std::logic_error`: For unsupported primitive execution.
#' @references - Chen, Rubanova, Bettencourt and Duvenaud(2018), Neural Ordinary Differential
#'   Equations, https://arxiv.org/abs/1806.07366 . This source differentiates
