#' - Grathwohl et al.(2018), FFJORD: Free-form Continuous Dynamics for Scalable
#'   Reversible Generative Models, https://arxiv.org/abs/1810.01367 . This2-D
#'   teaching adaptation uses a deterministic pair of probes, not a noisy single probe.
#' @seealso CnfDensity(), CnfIntegrate(), CnfField(), FlowScaleOutput
#' @md
#'
`CnfInverse` <- function(...) .Call(`.rs_1151`, NULL, list(...))
#' Transform explicit Gaussian triples into banana, ring-mixture or checkerboard observations.
#'
#' Accept finite Float32/64 CPU standard\[N,3\], N>0 and arbitrary strides.
#' Promote each value to Double before scalar math, then cast observations once
#' to dtype(default Float32). kind=0: (u,v+.5*(u*u-1)), component=-1.
