#' * `$prior_logit` (`Tensor`): Prior/real discriminator logits \[P,1\].
#' * `$encoded_logit` (`Tensor`): Encoded/fake discriminator logits \[B,1\].
#' * `$nll` (`Tensor`): Per-image summed Bernoulli NLL \[B\].
#' * `$reconstruction_loss` (`Tensor`): Mean NLL over B images, scalar.
#' * `$discriminator_loss` (`Tensor`): Mean softplus(-prior_logit)+mean softplus(encoded_logit), scalar.
#' * `$adversarial_loss` (`Tensor`): Mean softplus(-encoded_logit), non-saturating encoder objective,
