#' Own fifteen live class-conditional GAN endpoints and source/class objectives.
#'
#' Every Tensor owns storage and available autograd history independently of this
#' record and the caller's stores. No optimizer, random generator, mode switch,
#' fitting count, checkpoint selection or quadratic diagnostic is stored. Choose
#' update groups explicitly; no implicit detachment freezes either model.
#' @section Constructor:
#' `AuxiliaryClassifierGanOutput$new()`
#' @section Fields:
#' * `$fake` (`Tensor`): Live sigmoid generated coordinates \[N,features\].
#' * `$real_logit` (`Tensor`): Image-only real source logits \[N,1\].
#' * `$fake_logit` (`Tensor`): Generated-image source logits \[N,1\].
#' * `$real_probability` (`Tensor`): Real-image sigmoid source probabilities \[N,1\].
#' * `$fake_probability` (`Tensor`): Generated-image sigmoid source probabilities \[N,1\].
#' * `$discriminator_loss` (`Tensor`): Scalar source D loss plus (real CE + fake CE).
#' * `$generator_loss` (`Tensor`): Scalar non-saturating source G loss plus fake CE.
#' * `$real_class_logits` (`Tensor`): Image-only real auxiliary logits \[N,classes\].
#' * `$fake_class_logits` (`Tensor`): Generated-image auxiliary logits \[N,classes\].
#' * `$real_class_probability` (`Tensor`): Image-only real softmax predictions \[N,classes\].
#' * `$fake_class_probability` (`Tensor`): Generated-image softmax predictions \[N,classes\].
#' * `$real_class_loss` (`Tensor`): Scalar mean real-image CE against supplied targets.
#' * `$fake_class_loss` (`Tensor`): Scalar mean generated-image CE against requested classes.
#' * `$source_discriminator_loss` (`Tensor`): Scalar mean softplus(-real) + mean softplus(fake).
#' * `$source_generator_loss` (`Tensor`): Scalar non-saturating mean softplus(-fake).
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' #include <dm/dm.hpp>
#' namespace n=dm::nn;
#' n::ParameterStore g(5209),d(5219);
#' const auto
#' out=n::models::AuxiliaryClassifierGan(g,d,n::zeros({2,784}),n::zeros({2,16}),n::zeros({2},n::DType::Int32));
