#' Own eight live bidirectional GAN endpoints, including two unfitted cycle diagnostics.
#'
#' Tensor fields retain storage and applicable autograd history after this record
#' and parameter stores are destroyed. No optimizer, random generator, mode switch,
#' fit counter or checkpoint state is stored. Reconstruction/cycle fields are
#' computed for inspection; their residuals do not enter either fitting objective.
#' @section Constructor:
#' `BiganOutput$new()`
#' @section Fields:
#' * `$fake` (`Tensor`): Live generated coordinates \[M,F\], from prior only.
#' * `$encoded` (`Tensor`): Live encoded coordinates \[N,Z\], from data only.
#' * `$real_score` (`Tensor`): Live joint logits \[N,1\] for (image,encoded).
#' * `$fake_score` (`Tensor`): Live joint logits \[M,1\] for (fake,prior).
#' * `$discriminator_loss` (`Tensor`): Scalar mean softplus(-real_score) + mean softplus(fake_score).
#' * `$eg_loss` (`Tensor`): Scalar mean softplus(real_score) + mean softplus(-fake_score).
#' * `$reconstruction` (`Tensor`): Live G(E(image))\[N,F\], excluded from fitting objectives.
#' * `$latent_cycle` (`Tensor`): Live E(G(prior))\[M,Z\], excluded from fitting objectives.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' #include <dm/dm.hpp>
#' namespace n=dm::nn;
#' n::ParameterStore g(6007),e(6011),d(6029);
#' const auto out=n::models::BidirectionalGan(g,e,d,n::ones({2,2}),n::zeros({3,2}));
#' // reconstruction has 2 data rows; latent_cycle has 3 prior rows.
#' ```
#' @seealso BidirectionalGan(), BiganMap(), BiganJointScore()
#' @md
#'
