#' * `$recognition_loss` (`Tensor`): Live scalar categorical CE plus unit-Gaussian continuous NLL.
#' * `$categorical_loss` (`Tensor`): Live scalar generated-category mean CE.
#' * `$continuous_loss` (`Tensor`): Live scalar per-row summed unit-Gaussian NLL.
#' * `$mi_lower_bound` (`Tensor`): Live fixed-prior entropy minus R; not measured actual mutual information.
#' * `$q_logits` (`Tensor`): Live separate image-only Q categorical logits\[M,C\].
