#' Own both generator paths, source diagnostics, explicit losses and batch moment captures.
#'
#' All tensors and nested moments retain storage/applicable first/higher graphs
#' after parent/stores disappear. The selected fake/fake_score convenience fields
#' affect display only; D/G objectives ALWAYS use fake_training and its D score.
#' No optimizer, write counter, RNG, spectral/BN store reference or mode is retained.
#' @section Constructor:
#' `BigGanOutput$new()`
#' @section Fields:
#' * `$fake` (`Tensor`): Owning live selected display pixels\[N,8,8,1\], inference by default.
#' * `$fake_training` (`Tensor`): Owning live batch-statistics G pixels\[N,8,8,1\], used in both game losses.
#' * `$fake_inference` (`Tensor`): Owning live saved-statistics G pixels\[N,8,8,1\].
#' * `$fake_score_training` (`Tensor`): Owning live D score of training-path fake\[N,1\].
#' * `$fake_score_inference` (`Tensor`): Owning live D score of saved-statistics fake\[N,1\].
#' * `$real_score` (`Tensor`): Owning live real image/class D scores\[N,1\].
#' * `$fake_score` (`Tensor`): Owning live selected display score\[N,1\], matching fake convenience field.
#' * `$d_loss` (`Tensor`): Scalar mean(relu(1-real))+mean(relu(1+fake_score_training)).
#' * `$g_source` (`Tensor`): Scalar -mean(fake_score_training), without a generator hinge.
#' * `$g_orthogonal` (`Tensor`): Scalar modified raw G kernel penalty with source coefficient
#'   double(.5e-4f).
#' * `$g_loss` (`Tensor`): Scalar g_source+g_orthogonal, always using batch-statistics generation.
#' * `$moments` (`BigGanMoments`): Owning live six captured moment vectors from fake_training's forward.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' #include <dm/dm.hpp>
#' namespace n=dm::nn;
#' n::ParameterStore g(6803),d(6823),gs(0),ds(0),moving(0);
#' auto
#' out=n::models::BigGan(g,d,gs,ds,moving,n::zeros({2,8,8,1}),n::zeros({2,12}),n::zeros({2},n::DType::Int32));
#' // out.fake is inference display; out.g_loss still uses the batch-statistics fake.
#' ```
#' @references - Brock et al. (2018/2019), https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.11096 .
#' @seealso BigGan(), BigGanGenerated, BigGanDiscriminated
#' @md
#'
