#'
#'   Returns the best accepted validation metric.
#'
#' * `$best_epoch()` -> `integer`
#'
#'   Returns the epoch of the best accepted metric, or -1 before any observation.
#'
#' * `$misses()` -> `integer`
#'
#'   Returns consecutive non-improving observations since the latest improvement.
#' @md
#'
