#' Own both translations/cycles/identities, four patch maps and all explicit CycleGAN terms.
#'
#' Nineteen flat Tensor fields retain storage/applicable graphs after parent or
#' store collection. Unpaired domain row counts may differ. No optimizer,
#' derivative capture, hidden stop/no-grad, mutable batch state or schedule.
#' @section Constructor:
#' `CycleGanOutput$new()`
#' @section Fields:
#' * `$fake_a` (`Tensor`): Owning live G_ba(b)\[M,28,28,1\], from B source alone.
#' * `$fake_b` (`Tensor`): Owning live G_ab(a)\[N,28,28,1\], from A source alone.
#' * `$cycle_a` (`Tensor`): Owning live G_ba(G_ab(a))\[N,28,28,1\].
#' * `$cycle_b` (`Tensor`): Owning live G_ab(G_ba(b))\[M,28,28,1\].
#' * `$identity_a` (`Tensor`): Owning live G_ba(a)\[N,28,28,1\], source-domain identity control.
#' * `$identity_b` (`Tensor`): Owning live G_ab(b)\[M,28,28,1\], source-domain identity control.
#' * `$real_a_score` (`Tensor`): Owning live D_a(a)\[N,7,7,1\] raw patch scores.
#' * `$real_b_score` (`Tensor`): Owning live D_b(b)\[M,7,7,1\] raw patch scores.
#' * `$fake_a_score` (`Tensor`): Owning live D_a(fake_a)\[M,7,7,1\] raw patch scores.
#' * `$fake_b_score` (`Tensor`): Owning live D_b(fake_b)\[N,7,7,1\] raw patch scores.
#' * `$g_loss` (`Tensor`): Owning common G objective: adversarial sum+(cycle_weight*cycle
#'   sum+identity_weight*identity sum).
#' * `$d_a_loss` (`Tensor`): Owning half*(mean((real_a-1)^2)+mean(fake_a_score^2)).
#' * `$d_b_loss` (`Tensor`): Owning half*(mean((real_b-1)^2)+mean(fake_b_score^2)).
#' * `$adversarial_a` (`Tensor`): Owning mean((fake_a_score-1)^2), without half.
#' * `$adversarial_b` (`Tensor`): Owning mean((fake_b_score-1)^2), without half.
#' * `$cycle_loss_a` (`Tensor`): Owning mean(abs(cycle_a-a)), over all A pixels.
#' * `$cycle_loss_b` (`Tensor`): Owning mean(abs(cycle_b-b)), over all B pixels.
#' * `$identity_loss_a` (`Tensor`): Owning mean(abs(identity_a-a)), over all A pixels.
#' * `$identity_loss_b` (`Tensor`): Owning mean(abs(identity_b-b)), over all B pixels.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' #include <dm/dm.hpp>
#' namespace n=dm::nn;
#' n::ParameterStore ab(6203),ba(6211),da(6217),db(6221);
#' auto out=n::models::CycleGan(ab,ba,da,db,n::zeros({2,28,28,1}),n::ones({3,28,28,1}));
#' // fake_b/cycle_a have2 rows; fake_a/cycle_b have3 rows. The batches are unpaired.
#' ```
#' @references - Zhu et al. (2017), https://arxiv.org/abs/1703.10593 .
#' @seealso CycleGan(), CycleGanDiscriminate(), Pix2PixGenerate()
#' @md
