#' * `$second` (`Tensor`): Owning live second styled/noisy feature map\[N,8,8,4\].
#' * `$first_style` (`Tensor`): Owning raw affine scale-delta/shift\[N,8\] for AdaIN, actual channel
#'   gains\[N,4\] for version2.
#' * `$second_style` (`Tensor`): Owning second layer's raw affine\[N,8\] or actual channel gains\[N,4\].
#' * `$first_demodulator` (`Tensor`): Owning live\[N,4\] factors for version2; owning scalar1 for AdaIN.
#' * `$second_demodulator` (`Tensor`): Owning live\[N,4\] factors for version2; owning scalar1 for AdaIN.
