#' * `$cardinality` (`integer`): Positive group count for 3x3, one for ordinary ResNet.
#' * `$base_width` (`integer`): Positive base group width; ResNeXt uses four.
#' * `$reduction` (`integer`): Positive SE/CBAM divisor not exceeding branch output width.
#' * `$attention` (`character (ChannelAttention)`)
#' * `$small_stem` (`logical`): 3x3 stride-one stem without max pool instead of 7x7/2 and pool.
#' * `$stride_on_3x3` (`logical`): Stage stride belongs to conv2 when true, conv1 when false.
#' * `$adaptive_eca` (`logical`): Choose per-stage ECA size from output channels.
#' * `$eca_kernel` (`integer`): Fixed positive odd ECA size when adaptive_eca is false.
#' * `$deformable_from` (`integer`)
#' * `$modulated` (`logical`): Use logistic masks for deformable v2.
