#' Configure source24-convolution YOLO v1 with paper dense or explicit compact head.
#'
#' Full defaults use448RGB, no BN,4096 dense units and20 classes. Compact56gray
#' keeps all24 convolutions but removes initial/22nd stride and fourth max-pool
#' to retain7x7 features. Optional BN is a separate compact experiment.
#' @section Constructor:
#' `YoloV1Config$new()`
#' @section Fields:
#' * `$classes` (`integer`): Positive cell-level class score count.
#' * `$width_divisor` (`integer`): Positive divisor of64 for convolution widths.
#' * `$dense_width` (`integer`): Positive dense hidden width.
#' * `$compact` (`logical`)
#' * `$batch_norm` (`logical`): Optional BN; requires nonnull same-dtype state store.
#' * `$keep_probability` (`numeric`)
#' * `$momentum` (`numeric`): Optional BN moving-state momentum in\[0,1), epsilon1e-5.
#' * `$update_stats` (`logical`): Update optional BN moving state only in training when true.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' namespace n = dm::nn;
#' n::ParameterStore p(17), state(17);
#' n::models::YoloV1Config c;
#' c.classes = 10;
#' c.compact = true;
#' c.width_divisor = 8;
