#' * `$sample_variance` (`Tensor`): Float32unbiasedsample variance,n1returns0.
#' * `$standard_error` (`Tensor`): Float32sqrt(sample_variance/samples).
#' * `$standard_noise` (`Tensor`): Original Float64\[samples,N,...\]explicit standardized bank.
#' * `$noisy_input` (`Tensor`): Float32\[samples,N,...\]actual perturbed inputs,clipped only ifrequested.
