#' Own Gaussian posterior parameters, explicit samples and beta-weighted VAE objectives.
#'
#' Every tensor owns lifetime and retains autograd history. No RNG, optimizer or
#' fitting state is stored. Decode(mu) is not the posterior predictive mean.
#' @section Constructor:
#' `GaussianVaeOutput$new()`
#' @section Fields:
#' * `$mu` (`Tensor`): Linear posterior means \[B,latent\].
#' * `$log_variance` (`Tensor`): Linear posterior log variances \[B,latent\].
#' * `$z` (`Tensor`): Explicit reparameterized samples \[B,latent\].
#' * `$logits` (`Tensor`): Decoder log-odds \[B,features\].
#' * `$probability` (`Tensor`): Sigmoid decoder probabilities \[B,features\], not pixel draws.
#' * `$reconstruction_nll` (`Tensor`): Summed Bernoulli NLL per image \[B\], nats.
