#' Own all nineteen source VAE-GAN endpoints and its three explicit objectives.
#'
#' Every tensor owns lifetime and retains available autograd paths. The sole
#' deliberate feature-target barrier is inside feature_nll; real_feature itself
#' stays live. No RNG, optimizer, fitting counter or mode switch is stored.
#' The caller chooses which parameter group receives each objective's update.
#' @section Constructor:
#' `VaeGanOutput$new()`
#' @section Fields:
#' * `$mu` (`Tensor`): Posterior means \[B,latent\].
#' * `$log_variance` (`Tensor`): Posterior log variances \[B,latent\].
#' * `$z` (`Tensor`): Explicit reparameterized samples \[B,latent\].
#' * `$probability` (`Tensor`): Reconstructed sigmoid probabilities \[B,features\].
#' * `$prior_probability` (`Tensor`): Independent prior-code probabilities \[P,features\].
#' * `$real_feature` (`Tensor`): Live real-image discriminator features \[B,feature_width\].
#' * `$reconstruction_feature` (`Tensor`): Reconstructed-image features \[B,feature_width\].
#' * `$prior_feature` (`Tensor`): Prior-image discriminator features \[P,feature_width\].
#' * `$real_logit` (`Tensor`): Real-image discriminator logits \[B,1\].
#' * `$reconstruction_logit` (`Tensor`): Reconstructed-image logits \[B,1\].
#' * `$prior_logit` (`Tensor`): Prior-image logits \[P,1\].
#' * `$feature_nll` (`Tensor`): Half-summed squared features against detached real targets \[B\].
#' * `$kl` (`Tensor`): Coordinate-summed analytic standard-normal Gaussian KL \[B\].
#' * `$pixel_nll` (`Tensor`): Clipped Bernoulli pixel-NLL diagnostic \[B\], not fitted.
#' * `$mse` (`Tensor`): Pixel-mean squared reconstruction error \[B\], not fitted.
#' * `$encoder_loss` (`Tensor`): Scalar mean(feature_nll+kl), for encoder-only updates.
#' * `$generator_loss` (`Tensor`): Scalar mean(feature_nll)+generator_adversarial, for G only.
#' * `$discriminator_loss` (`Tensor`): Scalar real logistic loss plus half of each fake-branch loss.
#' * `$generator_adversarial` (`Tensor`): Scalar mean of two non-saturating fake-as-real losses.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' #include <dm/dm.hpp>
#' namespace n=dm::nn;
#' n::ParameterStore e(3301),g(3307),d(3313);
#' const auto out=n::models::VaeGan(e,g,d,n::zeros({2,784}),n::zeros({2,4}),n::zeros({3,4}));
#' // Distinct prior batch size3 is allowed; reconstruction still has2 rows.
#' ```
