#' Own all nineteen spatial/posterior/prior/reconstruction/objective hierarchy endpoints.
#'
#' Fields own lifetime and retain continuous paths. Neither greedy posterior
#' means nor decoded greedy means generally equal posterior predictive means.
#' @section Constructor:
#' `HierarchicalVaeOutput$new()`
#' @section Fields:
#' * `$encoder_feature` (`Tensor`): Quarter-resolution encoder map\[B,Hq,Wq,C\].
#' * `$top_feature` (`Tensor`): Sampled-top-conditioned map\[B,Hq,Wq,C\].
#' * `$top_mu` (`Tensor`): Top Gaussian mean\[B,T\], dependent only on image.
#' * `$top_lv` (`Tensor`): Top Gaussian log variance\[B,T\], dependent only on image.
#' * `$top_z` (`Tensor`): Supplied-noise top sample\[B,T\].
#' * `$prior_mu` (`Tensor`): Learned lower prior mean conditioned on sampled top\[B,Hq*Wq\].
#' * `$prior_lv` (`Tensor`): Learned lower prior log variance\[B,Hq*Wq\].
#' * `$head_mu` (`Tensor`): Direct lower mean or residual correction\[B,Hq*Wq\].
#' * `$head_lv` (`Tensor`): Direct lower log variance or residual correction\[B,Hq*Wq\].
#' * `$lower_mu` (`Tensor`): Lower posterior mean\[B,Hq*Wq\], conditioned on image AND sampled top.
#' * `$lower_lv` (`Tensor`): Lower posterior log variance\[B,Hq*Wq\].
#' * `$lower_z` (`Tensor`): Supplied-noise lower sample\[B,Hq*Wq\].
#' * `$probability` (`Tensor`): Bernoulli decoder probabilities\[B,height*width\], not sampled pixels.
#' * `$nll` (`Tensor`): Summed pixel Bernoulli NLL/cross-entropy per image\[B\].
#' * `$kl_lower` (`Tensor`): Conditional lower Gaussian KL summed over Hq*Wq coordinates\[B\].
#' * `$kl_top` (`Tensor`): Standard-normal top Gaussian KL summed over T coordinates\[B\].
#' * `$loss` (`Tensor`): Scalar mean(nll+(kl_lower+kl_top)), unregularized negative ELBO estimate.
#' * `$regularizer` (`Tensor`): Scalar smoothed two-prior-kernel penalty for NVAE, otherwise exact zero.
#' * `$train_loss` (`Tensor`): Scalar loss+regularizer; validation normally uses unregularized loss.
