#' * `$shuffled` (`Tensor`): Owning live CRD shuffled\[N,32,32,4\] for SRGAN, HR feature for ESRGAN.
#' * `$moments_mean` (`Tensor`): Owning detached training SRGAN means\[5,4\], otherwise undefined.
