#' Own both SR generator paths, raw scores, feature/loss boundaries and detached BN captures.
#'
#' Twenty flat fields retain storage/applicable graphs beyond parent/store
#' collection. prediction/residual use saved-statistic inference; prediction_training
#' and all objectives use batch-statistic G. Target feature extraction stops before
#' ReLU/scaling. moments_mean/unbiased_variance\[5,4\] are detached on SRGAN path,
#' undefined for ESRGAN; row order matches AdversarialSRGenerated. No captured
#' partials, optimizer state, fitting, EMA write or mutable callback is retained.
#' @section Constructor:
#' `AdversarialSROutput$new()`
#' @section Fields:
#' * `$prediction` (`Tensor`): Owning live saved-statistic inference image\[N,32,32,3\], no clipping.
#' * `$prediction_training` (`Tensor`): Owning live batch-statistic image\[N,32,32,3\], no clipping.
#' * `$residual` (`Tensor`): Owning live saved-statistic inference residual\[N,32,32,3\].
#' * `$real_score` (`Tensor`): Owning live raw target-image scores\[N,1\].
#' * `$fake_score` (`Tensor`): Owning live raw batch-statistic generated-image scores\[N,1\].
#' * `$fake_inference_score` (`Tensor`): Owning live raw saved-statistic generated-image scores\[N,1\].
#' * `$d_loss` (`Tensor`): Owning live ordinary logistic or half-scaled relativistic D objective.
#' * `$g_loss` (`Tensor`): Owning live(1-phase)*pixel_loss+phase*gan_loss; all components evaluated.
#' * `$gan_loss` (`Tensor`): Owning live content+source-rounded adversarial weight, plus ESRGAN pixel term.
#' * `$pixel_loss` (`Tensor`): Owning live batch-image MSE(SRGAN) or meanL1(ESRGAN) against target.
#' * `$content_loss` (`Tensor`): Owning live post-ReLU feature MSE(SRGAN) or pre-activation meanL1(ESRGAN).
#' * `$adversarial_loss` (`Tensor`): Owning live ordinary nonsaturating or half-scaled relativistic G term.
#' * `$relative_real` (`Tensor`): Owning live relative real score for ESRGAN, raw real score for SRGAN.
#' * `$relative_fake` (`Tensor`): Owning live relative fake score for ESRGAN, raw fake score for SRGAN.
#' * `$prediction_feature` (`Tensor`): Owning live source feature/ReLU selection divided by255\[N,32,32,64\].
#' * `$target_feature` (`Tensor`): Owning stopped target feature/ReLU selection divided by255\[N,32,32,64\].
#' * `$packed` (`Tensor`): Owning live source debug packed boundary from batch-statistic G.
#' * `$shuffled` (`Tensor`): Owning live source debug shuffled boundary from batch-statistic G.
#' * `$moments_mean` (`Tensor`): Owning detached SRGAN batch means\[5,4\], undefined for ESRGAN.
#' * `$moments_unbiased_variance` (`Tensor`): Owning detached SRGAN unbiased variances\[5,4\], undefined
#'   for ESRGAN.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' #include <dm/dm.hpp>
