#' Own both generator branches, local scores and the four single-scale losses.
#'
#' Eight flat owning Tensor handles retain storage/graphs after parent/store
#' collection. Generator is full fake-to-one LSGAN plus10*MSE reconstruction;
#' discriminator is half the sum of real-to-one and fake-to-zero means. No
#' detach is hidden in these outputs; caller owns gradient groups and writes.
#' @section Constructor:
#' `SingleImageGanOutput$new()`
#' @section Fields:
#' * `$fake` (`Tensor`): Owning live random branch image\[Nfake,H,W,3\].
#' * `$reconstruction` (`Tensor`): Owning live fixed-noise branch image\[Nreal,H,W,3\].
#' * `$real_score` (`Tensor`): Owning live image-only D(real)\[Nreal,H,W,1\].
#' * `$fake_score` (`Tensor`): Owning live image-only D(fake)\[Nfake,H,W,1\].
#' * `$d_loss` (`Tensor`): Owning live scalar .5*(mean((real_score-1)^2)+mean(fake_score^2)).
#' * `$g_loss` (`Tensor`): Owning live scalar adversarial_loss+10*reconstruction_loss.
#' * `$adversarial_loss` (`Tensor`): Owning live scalar mean((fake_score-1)^2), with no half factor.
#' * `$reconstruction_loss` (`Tensor`): Owning live scalar mean((reconstruction-real)^2), over all RGB values.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' #include <dm/dm.hpp>
#' namespace n=dm::nn;n::ParameterStore g(7307),d(7309);
#' auto x=n::zeros({1,4,6,3});auto o=n::models::SingleImageGan(g,d,x,x,x,x,x,n::ones({1}));
#' // Eight owning fields; g_loss=adversarial_loss+10*reconstruction_loss.
#' ```
#' @references - Rott Shaham, Dekel and Michaeli (2019), SinGAN: Learning a Generative Model
#'   from a Single Natural Image, https://arxiv.org/abs/1905.01164 . Source teaching
#'   variant substitutes least-squares losses for the paper's WGAN-GP.
#' @seealso SingleImageGan(), SingleImageGenerated
#' @md
#'
