#' * `$trace_a` (`Tensor`): Owning detached scalar real unbiased covariance trace.
#' * `$trace_b` (`Tensor`): Owning detached scalar fake unbiased covariance trace.
#' * `$cross_trace` (`Tensor`): Owning detached scalar sum of cross singular values.
#' * `$cross_singular_values` (`Tensor`): Owning detached Float64\[min(Nreal,Nfake)\] spectrum.
