#' Own live Bernoulli probabilities and teacher-forced image-density losses.
#'
#' Four flat tensors retain their input graphs/storage beyond parent lifetime.
#' loss averages all pixels and rows; per_image_nll sums each image in nats.
#' @section Constructor:
#' `BernoulliPixelOutput$new()`
#' @section Fields:
#' * `$probability` (`Tensor`): Owning live sigmoid(logits)\[N,H,W,1\] probabilities.
#' * `$pixel_nll` (`Tensor`): Owning live softplus(logits)-binary*logits\[N,H,W,1\] in nats.
#' * `$per_image_nll` (`Tensor`): Owning live sum over H,W,C\[N\], nats per image.
#' * `$loss` (`Tensor`): Owning live scalar mean over N,H,W,C, nats per binary pixel.
#' @section Examples (C++):
