#' * `$input_gates` (`Tensor`): Owning live biased mask-A3x3 input projection\[N,H,W,16\].
#' * `$row_gates` (`Tensor`): Owning live concatenated input+recurrent preactivations\[N,H,W,16\].
#' * `$hidden` (`Tensor`): Owning live concatenated output-gated hidden states\[N,H,W,4\].
#' * `$cell` (`Tensor`): Owning live concatenated recurrent cell states\[N,H,W,4\].
#' * `$logits` (`Tensor`): Owning live biased1x1 hidden4-to1 Bernoulli logits\[N,H,W,1\].
