#' auto out=n::models::PixelRnn(p,n::zeros({2,8,8,1}));
#' // logits[2,8,8,1], hidden/cell[2,8,8,4], input/row gates[2,8,8,16].
#' ```
#' @references - van den Oord, Kalchbrenner and Kavukcuoglu(2016), Pixel Recurrent Neural
