#' Own all compact IAF recovered inputs, autoregressive stages and density intermediates.
#'
#' Twenty-three flat Tensor handles retain applicable first/higher graphs and
#' storage after parent/store collection. Stage indices are source block names,
#' applied3,2,1,0 in density order. Each conditioner_input is the recovered
#' coordinate batch, also exposed as coupling, on which the final heads are
#' re-evaluated for that stage's density determinant. Scale fields are bounded
#' log scales, not exponentials. No fitting workflow, optimizer or sampler.
#' @section Constructor:
#' `IafDensityOutput$new()`
#' @section Fields:
#' * `$conditioner_input0` (`Tensor`): Owning live matching floating\[N,2\] source block0 fully recovered input for the final conditioner re-evaluation.
#' * `$coupling0` (`Tensor`): Owning live matching floating\[N,2\] source block0 recovered autoregressive stage value, alias of conditioner_input.
#' * `$coupling_logdet0` (`Tensor`): Owning live matching floating\[N\] source block0 negative sum of the final two bounded log scales.
#' * `$coupling_scale0` (`Tensor`): Owning live matching floating\[N,2\] source block0 bounded log scales re-evaluated on the recovered input.
#' * `$coupling_shift0` (`Tensor`): Owning live matching floating\[N,2\] source block0 Gaussian means re-evaluated on the recovered input.
#' * `$conditioner_input1` (`Tensor`): Owning live matching floating\[N,2\] source block1 fully recovered input for the final conditioner re-evaluation.
#' * `$coupling1` (`Tensor`): Owning live matching floating\[N,2\] source block1 recovered autoregressive stage value, alias of conditioner_input.
#' * `$coupling_logdet1` (`Tensor`): Owning live matching floating\[N\] source block1 negative sum of the final two bounded log scales.
#' * `$coupling_scale1` (`Tensor`): Owning live matching floating\[N,2\] source block1 bounded log scales re-evaluated on the recovered input.
