#' Own all three flow-study sample diagnostics, independent of fitted family.
#'
#' Scalar fields and the owning count Tensor survive parent/input collection.
#' No sample graph, fitted model, RNG or reference observations are retained.
#' Eight covered modes only means each count is positive; it does not establish
#' concentration near the modes. Support fraction and curvature are separate checks.
#' @section Constructor:
#' `FlowStudyDiagnosticsOutput$new()`
#' @section Fields:
#' * `$mode_counts` (`Tensor`): Owning detached contiguous Int32 CPU\[8\] nearest-mode counts at distance <=.45.
#' * `$checkerboard_support_fraction` (`numeric`): Fraction of rows in allowed half-open checkerboard cells.
#' * `$fraction_near_modes` (`numeric`): Fraction within .45 of a nearest radius-two ring center, including ties.
#' * `$modes_covered` (`integer`): Number of positive counts, in \[0,8\]; no concentration guarantee.
#' * `$banana_curvature_moment` (`numeric`): Double mean y*(x*x-1); true banana expectation is one.
#' @section Examples (C++):
