#' Own all nine detached Double tables of a cosine diffusion schedule.
#'
#' Flat owning Float64 CPU\[T\] fields survive parent collection, with no RNG,
#' model, static cache or optimizer retained. Field names follow the source
#' coefficient archive. Callers may construct explicit tables; consuming
#' operations validate only the fields they use and do not prove consistency
#' of an arbitrary user-supplied schedule.
#' @section Constructor:
#' `DiffusionScheduleOutput$new()`
#' @section Fields:
#' * `$beta` (`Tensor`): Detached Float64\[T\] forward conditional variances in (0,1).
#' * `$alpha` (`Tensor`): Detached Float64\[T\] one minus beta.
#' * `$alpha_bar` (`Tensor`): Detached Float64\[T\] serial cumulative products of alpha.
#' * `$alpha_bar_previous` (`Tensor`): Detached Float64\[T\] previous products, beginning with one.
#' * `$sqrt_alpha_bar` (`Tensor`): Detached Float64\[T\] positive signal coefficients.
#' * `$sqrt_one_minus_alpha_bar` (`Tensor`): Detached Float64\[T\] nonnegative forward-noise coefficients.
#' * `$posterior_variance` (`Tensor`): Detached Float64\[T\] fixed posterior variances; first is exactly zero.
#' * `$posterior_coefficient1` (`Tensor`): Detached Float64\[T\] coefficients multiplying predicted clean samples.
#' * `$posterior_coefficient2` (`Tensor`): Detached Float64\[T\] coefficients multiplying current noisy states.
#' @section Examples (C++):
#' ```cpp
#' #include <dm/dm.hpp>
#' auto s=dm::nn::models::CosineDiffusionSchedule();
#' // Nine independent owning Double[32] fields; posterior_variance[0]=0.
#' ```
#' @seealso CosineDiffusionSchedule(), DiffusionNoised(), DdpmReverse()
