#' @md
#'
`ResizeMethod` <- list(`Bilinear` = "Bilinear", `Nearest` = "Nearest")
#' Channel order of depth_to_space / space_to_depth (ONNX DepthToSpace modes).
#'
#' DCR (TF's order): channel (dy * b + dx) * C + c. CRD (PyTorch PixelShuffle, tflow's super-resolution pixel shuffle): channel c * b * b + dy * b + dx.
#' @format A list of enumerator names, which arguments of this type accept: `"DCR"`, `"CRD"`.
#' @md
#'
`DepthToSpaceMode` <- list(`DCR` = "DCR", `CRD` = "CRD")
#' How `grid_sample` interpolates.
